{
  "_comment": "Quote Coloring Page (Retirement Edition). One original retirement saying per page, printed as large outline lettering to color. Variety is structural: every requested saying gets its own brief (a retirement topic, a tone, a sentence form and a length band, shuffled by seed), so a book never reads as one saying reworded forty times. maxChars, maxWords and maxWordLetters mirror frontend/src/utils/studio/quote-coloring/content.ts. famousPhrases is a floor, not the originality check: the blind checker judges originality; this list catches the stock lines a model reaches for first. Matched on word boundaries, case-insensitive, apostrophes folded.",
  "limits": {
    "rateLimitPerWindow": 30,
    "maxOutputTokens": 4096,
    "checkMaxOutputTokens": 4096,
    "maxAttempts": 2,
    "poolSize": 10,
    "maxWrite": 12,
    "minChars": 12,
    "maxChars": 64,
    "minWords": 3,
    "maxWords": 12,
    "maxWordLetters": 11,
    "maxSameOpener": 2
  },
